<p>An Israeli air strike killed at least 10 people and wounded several others outside a school sheltering displaced Palestinians near Maghazi refugee camp in central Gaza on Monday, according to health officials and local sources. The strike came after clashes in the area involving Hamas-linked personnel and an Israeli-backed militia, putting new strain on a fragile US-backed ceasefire that the sources say has already faced repeated pressure. Residents and medics said displaced families had packed the area around the school when drones fired missiles, though it remained unclear how many of those killed were civilians. BBC said local sources described the strikes as targeting Hamas security personnel after they clashed with the militia, while Dawn also reported one Palestinian killed in an earlier strike on a motorbike in Gaza City and another killed when Israeli forces opened fire on a vehicle in central Gaza.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/MhC7RMQI52tZ0yZWvqlQLOw_bs5IAazehm-KYZajOFSMIFAw5mQJ_k6rKSJvhmcDTSAC1jzHhg8PqV96rdrl-QclyrhtZ7RcNXnQhApdsXr-' alt='Palestinians inspect the damage after a person was hit by an Israeli air strike while riding a bicycle in Gaza City.—Reuters' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>School shelter: The strike hit outside a school housing displaced Palestinians in a densely packed neighborhood east of Maghazi camp, increasing the danger for people already uprooted by the war.</li><li>Militia clashes: Residents and medics said the violence followed clashes with members of an Israeli-backed militia, whom Palestinians accused of attacking the school and trying to abduct people there.</li><li>Competing claims: In a later video, a leader of one Israeli-backed militia said the group killed about five Hamas members, while Hamas had no immediate public response in the cited reports.</li><li>Other deaths: Medics also said one Palestinian was killed in an earlier strike on a motorbike in Gaza City, and another was killed when Israeli forces opened fire on a vehicle in central Gaza.</li></ul><blockquote>The residents tried to defend their homes, but the occupation forces targeted them directly - Ahmed al-Maghazi</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Palestinian residents and medics: They said members of an Israeli-backed militia attacked the area around the school and tried to abduct people before Israeli drones fired missiles into the neighborhood. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1989261/israeli-air-strike-kills-10-near-gaza-school'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Local sources cited by BBC: They said the Israeli strikes targeted Hamas security personnel after clashes between those personnel and the Israeli-backed militia near Maghazi camp. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c77md512n71o'>BBC</a>)</li><li>Israeli-backed militia leader: In a video, he said the group had killed about five Hamas members during the fighting. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1989261/israeli-air-strike-kills-10-near-gaza-school'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Hamas: The group has described armed groups operating in areas under Israeli control as &#x27;Israeli collaborators,&#x27; according to the report. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1989261/israeli-air-strike-kills-10-near-gaza-school'>Dawn</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1989261/israeli-air-strike-kills-10-near-gaza-school'>Israeli air strike kills 10 near Gaza school</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/4/6/israeli-air-strike-kills-at-least-10-palestinians-near-gaza-school'>Israeli air strike kills at least 10 Palestinians near Gaza school</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/israeli-airstrike-kills-at-least-10-near-gaza-school-as-ceasefire-strains'>Israeli airstrike kills at least 10 near Gaza school as ceasefire strains</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c77md512n71o'>Ten killed in Israeli strikes and clashes between Hamas and militia in Gaza, local sources say</a> - bbc.com</li></ul>